---
import PortalLayout from '../layouts/PortalLayout.astro';
import Photo from '../components/brand/Photo.astro';
import '../styles/entry.css';
---

<PortalLayout
  title="Elegí cómo explorar · Manantiales Serranos"
  description="Dos formas de descubrir el Geoparque Manantiales Serranos: conocé sus lugares en el sitio web o recorré una experiencia inmersiva en 3D."
  bodyClass="entry-body"
>
  <a class="entry-skip" href="#elegi">
    Saltar a las opciones
  </a>
  <div class="entry-shell">
    <header class="entry-header">
      <img
        class="entry-brand"
        src="/brand/logo.svg"
        alt="Manantiales Serranos · Geoparque Mundial de la UNESCO"
        width="113"
        height="96"
      />
      <p class="entry-location">
        <span class="entry-location-dot"></span> LAVALLEJA, URUGUAY
      </p>
      <a class="entry-direct" href="/inicio/">
        Ir al sitio web <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
      </a>
    </header>

    <main class="entry-main" id="elegi">
      <div class="entry-intro">
        <div>
          <p class="entry-eyebrow">UN TERRITORIO. MUCHAS FORMAS DE SENTIRLO.</p>
          <h1>
            Un viaje.
            <br class="entry-mobile-break" /> <em>Otra mirada.</em>
          </h1>
        </div>
        <p class="entry-intro-copy">
          La Tierra tiene memoria.
          <br /> Elegí cómo querés descubrirla.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="entry-choices">
        <a
          class="entry-card entry-card-web"
          href="/inicio/"
          aria-labelledby="entry-web-title entry-web-action"
        >
          <div class="entry-card-visual">
            <Photo
              assetKey="arequita-rio"
              alt="Cerro Arequita y río Santa Lucía, en las sierras de Lavalleja"
              loading="eager"
              fetchpriority="high"
              sizes="(max-width: 720px) 92vw, (max-width: 1600px) 45vw, 720px"
              avif
            />
            <span class="entry-visual-label">
              <span></span> EL TERRITORIO TE ESPERA
            </span>
            <span class="entry-visual-number" aria-hidden="true">
              01
            </span>
          </div>
          <div class="entry-card-content">
            <p class="entry-card-kicker">EL SITIO WEB</p>
            <h2 id="entry-web-title">Descubrí tu próximo destino.</h2>
            <p class="entry-card-copy">Conocé los lugares, leé sus historias y armá tu viaje.</p>
            <div class="entry-card-action">
              <span id="entry-web-action">Explorar el sitio</span>
              <span class="entry-arrow" aria-hidden="true">
                ↗
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </a>

        <a
          class="entry-card entry-card-world"
          href="/experiencia/"
          data-astro-reload
          data-astro-prefetch="false"
          aria-labelledby="entry-world-title entry-world-action"
        >
          <div class="entry-card-visual entry-world-visual" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="entry-orbit entry-orbit-one"></div>
            <div class="entry-orbit entry-orbit-two"></div>
            <svg class="entry-world-art" viewBox="0 0 800 350" fill="none">
              <defs>
                <linearGradient
                  id="entry-island-top"
                  x1="160"
                  y1="110"
                  x2="650"
                  y2="310"
                  gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse"
                >
                  <stop stop-color="#a5b56f" />
                  <stop offset="1" stop-color="#587e55" />
                </linearGradient>
                <linearGradient
                  id="entry-river"
                  x1="250"
                  y1="210"
                  x2="560"
                  y2="180"
                  gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse"
                >
                  <stop stop-color="#82c2bb" />
                  <stop offset="1" stop-color="#3a8a91" />
                </linearGradient>
                <filter id="entry-island-shadow" x="-30%" y="-30%" width="160%" height="200%">
                  <feGaussianBlur stdDeviation="15" />
                </filter>
                <g id="entry-tree">
                  <path d="M-2 0h4v-25h-4z" fill="#594f35" />
                  <path d="m0-62 17 24-6 16H-8l-12-15z" fill="#3e6951" />
                  <path d="m0-62 17 24-6 16-8-15z" fill="#2f5542" />
                </g>
                <g id="entry-beacon">
                  <ellipse
                    rx="16"
                    ry="6"
                    fill="#9de9d4"
                    fill-opacity=".2"
                    stroke="#baf7dc"
                    stroke-opacity=".6"
                  />
                  <path d="M0-45V-5" stroke="#baf7dc" stroke-dasharray="3 4" />
                  <circle cy="-50" r="6" fill="#d4e885" />
                  <circle cy="-50" r="12" stroke="#c8f6d5" stroke-opacity=".5" />
                </g>
              </defs>
              <ellipse
                cx="410"
                cy="303"
                rx="230"
                ry="20"
                fill="#071b19"
                opacity=".6"
                filter="url(#entry-island-shadow)"
              />
              <path d="m115 203 214-92 348 88-12 50-267 83-262-76z" fill="#8a7756" />
              <path d="m398 271 279-72-12 50-267 83z" fill="#594f3e" />
              <path d="m115 203 214-107 348 103-279 91z" fill="url(#entry-island-top)" />
              <path
                d="m115 203 283 87 279-91"
                stroke="#c0ce8a"
                stroke-opacity=".6"
                stroke-width="2"
              />
              <path
                d="m304 112 30 21-2 22 64 26 8 24 69 20-19 13-77-22-12-24-76-27 7-24-26-18z"
                fill="#c3c49b"
              />
              <path
                d="m314 112 29 20-3 25 68 24 7 23 70 21-21 8-77-23-12-24-75-27 7-24-25-18z"
                fill="url(#entry-river)"
              />
              <path d="m421 160 32-60 22 12 18-24 44 78-45 18z" fill="#6c7355" />
              <path d="m453 100 22 12 18-24 44 78-48-19-13-25-15 12z" fill="#a39d7d" />
              <path d="m456 102 19 10 17-22-3 57-13-25-15 12z" fill="#c7bc98" />
              <path d="m503 183 37-48 21 21 16-11 34 49-45 12z" fill="#6d7855" />
              <path d="m540 135 21 21 16-11 34 49-45-19z" fill="#adb18b" />
              <path
                d="m180 214 50-17 27 6 18-11 27 9 10-22 34-3"
                stroke="#e0cb98"
                stroke-width="7"
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
              />
              <path
                d="m391 250 21-15 40 13 40-8 39-12 28-2"
                stroke="#d4c190"
                stroke-width="6"
                stroke-linecap="round"
              />
              <g opacity=".95">
                <use href="#entry-tree" x="203" y="194" />
                <use href="#entry-tree" x="235" y="179" transform="translate(35 40) scale(.85)" />
                <use href="#entry-tree" x="251" y="168" />
                <use href="#entry-tree" x="220" y="227" transform="translate(30 30) scale(.8)" />
                <use href="#entry-tree" x="589" y="220" />
                <use href="#entry-tree" x="620" y="209" transform="translate(125 35) scale(.8)" />
                <use href="#entry-tree" x="545" y="253" transform="translate(180 90) scale(.65)" />
              </g>
              <g transform="translate(365 216)">
                <ellipse cy="10" rx="13" ry="4" fill="#2f5140" opacity=".4" />
                <path d="m-7-4 2 16h5l2-16M2-4l4 16h5L8-5" fill="#334a3e" />
                <path d="m-9-22-2 23 21 1-2-23z" fill="#f2dfb5" />
                <path d="m-8-20-5 17 4 1 8-15M6-20l7 14-4 2-9-13" fill="#e6cb9b" />
                <rect x="-9" y="-21" width="15" height="17" rx="3" fill="#b88c42" />
                <circle cy="-31" r="7" fill="#d4ad7e" />
                <ellipse cy="-36" rx="13" ry="4" fill="#d5c389" />
                <path d="M-8-36v-6q8-7 16 0v6" fill="#dfcf9c" />
              </g>
              <use href="#entry-beacon" x="268" y="211" />
              <use href="#entry-beacon" x="501" y="190" />
              <use href="#entry-beacon" x="422" y="266" />
              <path
                d="m92 111 29-14m552 185 28-13M157 281l15 6m401-208 18 5"
                stroke="#a7d7b9"
                stroke-opacity=".35"
              />
            </svg>
            <span class="entry-visual-label">
              <span></span> UNA NUEVA PERSPECTIVA
            </span>
            <span class="entry-visual-number" aria-hidden="true">
              02
            </span>
            <span class="entry-world-tag">
              EXPERIENCIA 3D <span>↗</span>
            </span>
          </div>
          <div class="entry-card-content">
            <p class="entry-card-kicker">LA EXPERIENCIA INMERSIVA</p>
            <h2 id="entry-world-title">Ponete en marcha.</h2>
            <p class="entry-card-copy">
              Recorré un paisaje 3D e interactuá con los puntos del Geoparque.
            </p>
            <div class="entry-card-action">
              <span id="entry-world-action">Entrar a la experiencia</span>
              <span class="entry-arrow" aria-hidden="true">
                ↗
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </a>
      </div>
    </main>

    <footer class="entry-footer">
      <p>
        GEOLOGÍA <span>·</span> NATURALEZA <span>·</span> CULTURA
      </p>
      <p>
        Vení con curiosidad. Volvé con otra mirada.
        <br />
        <a href="/creditos-fotograficos/#gms-01">Foto: Bienflorencia · CC BY-SA 4.0</a>
      </p>
      <span class="entry-footer-mark" aria-hidden="true">
        MS / UY
      </span>
    </footer>
  </div>
</PortalLayout>
